# Scenario 'mailbox_ops': メールボックス operations that 'mail_inbox' skipped. Sender page of mail 1 -> SELECT (save the sender): the slot list of the address book
# is walked with DOWN x5 / UP x5 (cursor sprites and name highlight moves, 2A:SaveSenderAddr_*), slot 1 is already used, so A asks "メールアドレスを うわがきします
# よろしいですか?": いいえ (default) first, then はい (LEFT+A). Then the reply icon of mail 2 is pressed while the outbox still holds the reply saved by
# 'mail_inbox' ([A000] != 0): the dialog "おくってないメールがあります。へんじをかくことが できません。" (25:44AC). Starts from the state left by 'mail_inbox'.
# Screen names = my reading of the screenshots.
wait 400
waitstable 60 max 600
gap 30
tap A
waitstable 60 max 600
tap A
waitstable 60 max 600
tap A
waitstable 60 max 600
tap DOWN x2
wait 30
tap A                        # メールボックス
waitstable 60 max 600
shot list
# --- sender page of mail 1 -> SELECT (save sender) -> slot list with cursor moves
tap A
wait 60
tap A                        # read
waitstable 60 max 600
shot sender
tap SELECT
waitstable 60 max 600
shot slots
tap DOWN
wait 60
shot slots_d1
tap DOWN x4
wait 100
shot slots_d5
tap UP x2
wait 80
tap UP x3
wait 80
shot slots_top
tap A                        # slot 1 is used (the sender saved by mail_inbox): overwrite question
waitstable 60 max 600
shot overwrite_q
tap A                        # いいえ (default)
waitstable 60 max 600
shot overwrite_no
tap SELECT
waitstable 60 max 600
tap A
waitstable 60 max 600
tap LEFT
wait 40
shot overwrite_yes
tap A                        # はい
waitstable 60 max 600
shot overwrite_done
tap A
waitstable 60 max 600
tap B
waitstable 60 max 600
shot after_save
tap A                        # body page
waitstable 60 max 600
shot body
tap A                        # back to the list
waitstable 60 max 600
shot list_again
# --- reply while the outbox still holds a mail: "おくってないメールがあります。へんじをかくことが できません。"
tap DOWN
wait 40
tap A
wait 60
tap RIGHT
wait 40
shot bar_reply
tap A
waitstable 60 max 600
shot reply_blocked
tap A
waitstable 60 max 600
shot after_blocked
